{title: Maine Tere Liye Hi Saat Rang Ke}
{artist: Aanand Mukesh Salil Chowdhury}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Maine, tere liye hi        saat rang ke sa[B]pne chune,
Sap[A]ne, surile sap[E]ne.

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Kuch hanste ke, kuch[A]ghum ke,        Teri[E]ankhon ke,[A]saye,
chu[B]raye, ras[A]eeli[E]yaadon ne,

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Chooti baatein;        [E]Chooti chooti baaton ki hai
yaadein badi,        [A]Bhoole nahin, bithi hui ek,
[B]chooti ghadi.        [E]Janam janam se,[D]aankhein bichaye,
[A]Tere liye, in[B]rahoon ne.

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Roothi raatein;        [E]Roothi hui raaton ko manaya kabhi,
[A]Tere liye, mithi subah ko        [B]bulaya kabhi.
[E]Roothi raatein;        [E]Roothi hui raaton ko manaya kabhi,
[A]Tere liye, mithi subah ko        [B]bulaya kabhi.
[E]Tere bina bhi,[D]tere liye hi,        [A]Diye jalaye[B]rahoon mein,

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Bholay bhaley;        [E]Bhole bhale dil ko behlate rahe,
[A]Tanhai mein, tere khayalon ko        sa[B]jate rahe.
[E]Bholay bhaley;        [E]Bhole bhale dil ko behlate rahe,
[A]Tanhai mein, tere khayalon ko        sa[B]jate rahe.
[E]Kabhi kabhi to,[D]aawaaz dekar,        [A]Mujhko jagaya[B]khwabon ne,

